{
  "id": "u1gjoimg",
  "slug": "pocket-sniffer",
  "title": "Pocket Sniffer",
  "description": "Adds a beautiful snall cute sniffer to your inventory",
  "body": "<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/35f87c5da306c6dc385ae71645cf5c0eca3ccee0.png\" alt=\"📕 Discription 📕\" width=\"432\" height=\"72\">\n\nOnce installed, this resource pack will add a cute **little sniffer** to your inventory, sniffing with its big nose, saving you from loneliness.\n\nThe cute sniffer is added to your inventory menu in both Survival and Creative modes.\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/745ce5ea2438055fcc617cf48dff3cca0578b7b7.png\" alt=\"🔧 Installation 🔨\" width=\"450\" height=\"72\">\n\n1. Download the resource pack\n2. Drop it into the resourcepacks folder\n3. Download Mods: **Animatica & OptiGUI**\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b43cc796761cde86eeb47949ab4ea8c878fbadec.png\" alt=\"❗❗ Requirements ❗❗\" width=\"504\" height=\"72\">\n\nTo use the resource pack, you will need the **Animatica** mod.\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/animaticarefabricated\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eee19bdb92d71a7cb2b9874cc2761dd71244e107.png\" alt=\"Animatica Required Install\"></a>\n\nYou will also need the **OptiGUI** mod.\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/optigui\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e0413d5c40577ae08f5a3efcab765c0ec39682f6.png\" alt=\"OptiGUI Required Install\"></a>",
